# df-telemetry/ is Digital Frontier's hook payload. A rebase that touches it
# MUST be human-reviewed — enforced by scripts/df-telemetry-treehash.sh in
# auto-merge.yaml, NOT by this file. Deliberately NO merge driver here: a
# `merge=ours` driver would silently keep our version, which is exactly the
# silent-failure mode the tree-hash guard exists to prevent. This comment is
# the signpost; there is nothing to configure.

# Shell scripts and the smoke harness run on Linux CI runners — keep LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
